    "body": "This was incorrectly forcing the vectorcall code on `(CYTHON_COMPILING_IN_CPYTHON && CYTHON_ASSUME_SAFE_MACROS && !CYTHON_AVOID_BORROWED_REFS)` when it should just use `CYTHON_VECTORCALL`\r\n\r\nAn extra change to guard `__Pyx_CyFunction_func_vectorcall` is needed on 3.2.x",
